00:58:20.400 --> 00:58:26.280
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who just popped in, just popped his head in the door with this question,
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督：托里·马拉蒂亚。他刚刚推门进来，问了这个问题：

00:58:26.280 --> 00:58:28.860
<v Mike Paterniti>"What the hell do you think you're doing, booby?"
<v Mike Paterniti>“你到底在搞什么鬼，笨蛋？”

00:58:28.860 --> 00:58:32.820
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week, with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:32.820 --> 00:58:56.030
<v Mike Paterniti>"Did anyone tell you we're dealing with human lives here?"
<v Mike Paterniti>“有没有人告诉过你，我们处理的是人命？”

00:58:56.030 --> 00:59:01.030
